  "notes": [
    "Fills come only from the execution topic (dedupe on execId; the second delivery of execId ...0002 is dropped -> dedupe_dropped 1). Order-topic PartiallyFilled/Filled produce no events.",
    "Double orderStatus=Filled (documented): the second one carries cancelType=CancelByUser and rejectReason=EC_OrigClOrdIDDoesNotExist; the importer maps it to cancel_reject, never to a second terminal.",
    "Amends are not reported as events by Bybit; the importer infers amend_ack by diffing price/qty against the previous order-topic state. amend_keeps_priority = null (Bybit documents nothing).",
    "Order-topic updatedTime is tagged record_time (importer choice, undocumented semantics); with SPEC 5.7.2 entry=exchange_ack this forces send_plus_latency fallback for every Bybit order (SPEC gap).",
    "Post-only cross arrives as orderStatus=Cancelled + EC_PostOnlyWillTakeLiquidity -> post_only_reject.",
    "SMP cancel (cancelType CancelBySmp) and IOC remainder cancel are exchange-initiated -> expire.",
    "execTime / createdTime / updatedTime are JSON strings of ms; seq is a JSON number; isMaker a bool."
  ],
